a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">字节跳动视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日全量开放API</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，三档定价策略冲击AI开发市场</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布LiteRT.js加速库，Web端AI推理性能最高提升3倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/06124e81b4c0aa159880ffd9eabfb1ec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布全新Web端AI推理加速库LiteRT.js，旨在替代TensorFlow.js的传统JavaScript内核方案。该库核心采用WebAssembly二进制指令格式，并深度集成WebGPU与WebNN硬件加速能力，显著提升浏览器中机器学习工作负载的执行效率。在搭载M4芯片的2024款MacBook Pro实测中，LiteRT.js的推理速度较现有方案最高提升3倍。此次架构升级标志着谷歌推动Web端AI从纯JavaScript向高性能硬件加速阶段演进，使浏览器运行AI模型的速度更接近原生应用水平。对于开发者而言，该技术降低了端侧AI部署门槛，无需安装客户端即可实现流畅的AI功能体验，将有效推动Web端AI应用的普及与性能优化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯拟接盘AI初创公司Manus并成为最大股东，估值达20亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97ef792120e26c5284778ab38c44f9d0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯控股正洽谈成为新加坡AI初创公司Manus的最大股东，计划以20亿美元估值撤销此前Meta Platforms的收购案。该交易涉及腾讯、真格基金、红杉中国及管理层，腾讯预计将认购最多股份。Manus成立于2022年，由肖弘、季逸超和张涛创立，专注于AI Agent领域，其年度经常性收入（ARR）已接近5亿美元。交易完成后，Manus将保持独立运营，并计划在香港上市。此次合作背景下，腾讯正加速在微信中测试嵌入式AI智能体，创始人肖弘已作为外部专家参与测试。对于腾讯而言，此举旨在深化AGI时代的底层生态布局，加速微信AI智能体等前沿产品的应用落地，同时Manus需通过重组以满足中国监管要求。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日全量开放API</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d8a99773646ec407ef9c7515421df4da.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动旗下视频生成模型Seedance2.5将于7月16日正式全量开放API，标志着该模型从灰度测试转向全面商用。Seedance2.5在6月23日发布，目前字节旗下AI创作平台“即梦”已开启上线预热，并配套会员折扣与积分优惠。技术层面，该模型实现三大突破：支持30秒单段原生视频直出，大幅提升连贯性；参考素材容量提升至最高50个全模态素材，增强复杂场景理解；引入高可控性视频编辑功能，优化画面主体与运镜的精准微调。行业预计其定价将与2.0版本持平。此次全量商用将加速AI视频生成技术在影视创意及商业广告领域的工程化落地，降低高品质视频创作门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，三档定价策略冲击AI开发市场</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c493c4636b6ed89435c6afaf53b4e36.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI今日正式向全球全量开放GPT-5.6系列模型，推出旗舰版Sol、均衡版Terra及性价比版Luna三款产品，并于24小时内覆盖ChatGPT、Codex和API。定价方面，三款模型每百万Token输入/输出价格分别为5/30美元、2.5/15美元和1/6美元，其中Luna价格仅为Anthropic Fable 5的十六分之一。性能上，Sol在Agents&#x27; Last Exam评测中以53.6分超越Fable 5，并在编程智能体指数中以80分刷新纪录。GPT-5.6引入ultra模式支持16个智能体并行，在ExploitBench测试中得分提升至73.5%。尽管Sol在SWE-Bench Pro及FrontierMath等深度工程与数学领域表现不及Fable 5，但其极致的性价比策略显著改变了行业竞争</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta 发布旗舰模型 Muse Spark 1.1，升级多代理自动化与上下文压缩功能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab4da36137c14965b56ec16876692b7a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta 正式发布旗舰大模型 Muse Spark 1.1，重点优化多代理自动化工作流程，现已通过 Meta AI 及 API 开放公众预览。该模型支持 100 万标记的上下文窗口，并引入上下文压缩机制，能有效保存关键细节以实现子任务间的数据传递。在多代理协作中，主代理负责制定计划，Muse Spark 1.1 可实时检测执行变化并动态调整。性能方面，该模型在 Vibe Code Bench v1.1 基准测试中得分 72.2，较前代提升超 50 分，在 SWE-Atlas Codebase QnA 测试中得分提升近 18%。其擅长处理复杂编程任务，如自动识别并修复代码问题，同时支持电商描述生成及多步骤订单处理等应用。开发者可通过 Meta Model API 接入使用。此外，Meta 计划明年将数据中心容量提</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
